WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Welcome to this demo video

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
We're testing subtitle support

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
This is a multi-language example

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.000
You can switch between different languages

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.000
The subtitles are synchronized with the video

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
And they support multiple lines
of text if needed

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.000
You can style them using CSS

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.000
And they work with any video format

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Thanks for watching!

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Don't forget to try other languages